{"id":"9f10a368431d07c8","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Hull Condensation","display":"df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation — ZFC Inner3 Hull Condensation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation — ZFC Inner3 Hull Condensation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-hull-condensation — ZFC Inner3 Hull Condensation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfcd8a7128928cfb\" href=\"?note=dfcd8a7128928cfb\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本定义在固定环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V\">\\(L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq\\in V\\)</span> 下解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\trianglelefteq\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\">\\(\\trianglelefteq\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\\)</span>；环境与被调用的五元相对定义一致，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hull}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hull}\\)</span> 任意存在量化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>，参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\">\\((M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3HullCondensation}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 是在上述固定环境内定义的一元兼容谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}hull\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3HullCondensation}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}hull\\text{-}condensation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3HullCondensation}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7HullCondensation}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Hull},\\mathcal B,\\trianglelefteq).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-model7-hull-condensation.md","status":"resolved","id":"dfcd8a7128928cfb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":